 choices matter. Classic RPG Maker Horror x Otome vibes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241170/8aa77ff64bc2c1b931a1383e6b0f7580017ca0f8/header.jpg?t=1777866466", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241170/7abfba689d08810aaeab1126637a94f514c0eda0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777866466", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241170/7abfba689d08810aaeab1126637a94f514c0eda0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777866466", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 / GPU supporting OpenGL<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you run the game on a monitor with more than 60hz, please make sure FPS Synch in the options is set to ON.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Starlit Castle"], "publishers": ["Starlit Castle"], "demos": [{"appid": 4390800, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241170/9a50f83c9eec1e201cc194fef62e158da03ac71d/ss_9a50f83c9eec1e201cc194fef62e158da03ac71d.600x338.jpg?t=1777866466", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241170/9a50f83c9eec1e201cc194fef62e158da03ac71d/ss_9a50f83c9eec1e20